  "details": "Having a problem when you quit then you can see VRChat is running but there's no VRChat running just the system even if you don't understand why they can't kill VRChat on Task manager.\n\nFigured out and asked them my friends have no idea about it VRChat hidden malware or something.\n\nThere's another bug\n\nIf you play VRChat now then when you want to use chatbox and it appears multiple \"search world\" and \"search user\" which made you confused.\n\nIt's really annoying and disappointing when requires restarting the PC to kill VRC or get rid of it.\n\nI am aware VRChat update is broken and may cause something like this, Why didn't they check this or just for me?\n\nI tried reinstalling and verifying the game's files but still fine. I don't understand why?\n\nUPDATED\n\nAfter few hours\n\nMaybe it was cloned VRChat another app in the system I believe it's the update but before without a problem. We don't have more information about this risk.\n\nCrashes, Dropping FPS or suspect VRC is cloning.",
